/**
 * Master Raw SVG templates for the Shinobi / Anime Ninja Arc README theme.
 * Extracted with authentic Konoha aesthetic, rotating roles, radar telemetry,
 * swinging ninja ID registration lanyard card, torchlight jutsu beam, and animated SVGs.
 *
 * FULLY DYNAMIC:
 * - Dynamic user name & handle across all cards and banners
 * - Dynamic bio / mission text with automatic length & wrapping calculation
 * - Dynamic cycling roles based on user stack / headline
 * - Dynamic telemetry metrics (repos, stars, followers, forks)
 * - Dynamic Jutsu Arsenal chips generated from user selected skills / top languages
 * - Dynamic ninja registration ID card (avatar, location, company, top repos bar chart)
 * - Dynamic ninja way pillars (workingOn, learning, collaborateOn, askMeAbout)
 * - Dynamic connect squad links (GitHub, email, socials)
 */

